---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="How Bundle Technologies Ltd collects, uses and protects personal data, plain-English summary first, full UK GDPR detail below."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Privacy policy"
    lead="Last updated: 29 September 2026 · Plain-English summary first, full detail below."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <div class="prose reveal">
        <div class="callout">
          <p><strong>The short version</strong></p>
          <ul>
            <li>We collect only what we need to run your account and improve this site.</li>
            <li>We never sell your data, to anyone, for anything.</li>
            <li>Your email is used only for product updates, nothing else.</li>
            <li>Your email is used only for what you agreed to, and the opt-in box is never pre-ticked.</li>
            <li>
              You do not have to ask us to delete your data:
              <a href="/legal/data-deletion">do it yourself in one click</a>, or
              email <a href="mailto:privacy@bundle.ai">privacy@bundle.ai</a>.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          Bundle Technologies Ltd (“Bundle”, “we”) is a company registered in
          England and Wales, based in London. We are building an
          education-first platform for startup investing; no investment
          services are live yet, so the personal data we hold is limited to
          what this website collects. For the purposes of the UK GDPR and the
          Data Protection Act 2018, Bundle Technologies Ltd is the controller
          of that data.
        </p>

        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>We deliberately collect very little.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Account details.</strong> Your email address and, if you
            choose to tell us, which best describes you, investor, founder or
            simply curious. That is the whole form, by design.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Analytics-lite.</strong> Aggregate usage data, which pages
            are read, roughly where visitors come from, measured without
            cross-site tracking. We do not use marketing pixels, advertising
            identifiers or fingerprinting.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Correspondence.</strong> If you email us, we keep the
            exchange so we can reply properly and remember the context next
            time.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Legal bases</h2>
        <p>
          Under the UK GDPR we rely on two legal bases. <strong>Consent</strong>,
          when you opt into product emails, you can withdraw it at any time by
          unsubscribing or emailing us, and withdrawing is as easy as joining
          was. <strong>Legitimate interests</strong>, for minimal analytics,
          administering the site and keeping it secure, interests we have
          balanced against your rights and freedoms.
        </p>

        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          Account data is kept until you delete it, which you can do yourself at
          any moment. Correspondence is kept for up to two years after a thread
          closes. Newsletter subscriptions last until you unsubscribe. We do not
          keep personal data “just in case”. The full retention table is on the
          <a href="/legal/data-deletion">data deletion</a> page.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You have the right to access the personal data we hold about you, to
          have it rectified or erased, to receive it in a portable format, and
          to restrict or object to certain processing. One plain email to
          <a href="mailto:privacy@bundle.ai">privacy@bundle.ai</a> is enough, no forms. You also have the right to complain to the Information
          Commissioner’s Office (<a href="https://ico.org.uk" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a>),
          though we would appreciate the chance to put things right first.
        </p>
        <p>
          Two of those rights are buttons rather than requests. On the
          <a href="/legal/data-deletion">data deletion</a> page you can download
          everything we hold about you as a file, and delete all of it, without
          contacting anyone.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies and on-device storage</h2>
        <p>
          Bundle sets no cookies at all. What it remembers, your plan, your
          holdings, your display preferences, sits in your own browser's local
          storage and is never transmitted to us. No advertising tags, no
          cross-site tracking, no pixels, no fingerprinting.
        </p>
        <p>
          You still get a consent banner, and the reason is worth stating:
          it records your decision <em>before</em> anything optional exists,
          rather than after the tags have already fired. Accepting and refusing
          are the same single click, and optional categories start switched off.
          The <a href="/legal/cookies">cookie policy</a> lists every item stored,
          what it is for and how long it lasts, and you can change your answer
          from the footer of any page.
        </p>
        <p>
          One third party is contacted on every page: Google Fonts serves the
          typefaces, which means your IP address reaches Google to fetch them.
          No other third-party domain is involved.
        </p>

        <h2>Marketing email</h2>
        <p>
          The newsletter is opt-in, on its own unticked box, and never a
          condition of opening an account or using anything here. The box says
          what you will get and how often at the point of asking. We record the
          fact and time of your consent so it can be evidenced, and withdrawing
          is one click from any email or one line to
          <a href="mailto:privacy@bundle.ai">privacy@bundle.ai</a>. Unsubscribing
          removes you, it does not move you to a quieter list.
        </p>

        <h2>AI and your data</h2>
        <p>
          Bundle is building AI-assisted tools, so it matters to say this
          precisely: where AI features process personal data, they operate
          under human oversight, and we make no automated decisions with legal
          or similarly significant effects about you without human review.
          Your personal data is not used to train AI models.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions, requests or complaints:
          <a href="mailto:privacy@bundle.ai">privacy@bundle.ai</a>, or write to
          Bundle Technologies Ltd, London, United Kingdom. We aim to respond to
          rights requests well within the one-month statutory window.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .callout > p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .callout ul {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
  }
</style>
